{
  "_note": "Limits for the review tools (docs/review/PLAYTEST-REVIEW-PLAN.md section 1b). Starting guesses: review:calibrate compares them with thumbs-up/down and suggests new values. Change numbers here, never in code. category = the review category a finding is filed under; severity 1 cosmetic, 2 friction, 3 blocks or confuses, 4 breaks the game. Bots and players are measured differently: standingStill.noTaskS (bots: no sensible task on offer) matches the 5 s of the plan, while players only report movement, so realLongestStillS and realStillShare are higher. repetition.trips counts identical trips (bots); repetition.deliveries counts items (PlayShape.sameRunMax, players). tolerance: a tracked number moved when it changed by more than abs and more than rel times its previous value.",
